--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
llama.cpp — a dependency, not redistributed here
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Home:       https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
Licence:    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors

aiopt performs inference through llama.cpp and links against it, but carries no
copy of it. The build resolves it in one of three ways: an existing llama target
supplied by the surrounding project, a checkout named by AIOPT_LLAMA_SOURCE_DIR,
or a pinned FetchContent download. In every case the source is obtained from the
project above under its own licence.

