Language models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are contained in this repository. The examples name a model to
fetch at build time, and each is distributed by its own publisher under its own
terms, which are not granted by this project. Anyone redistributing a build that
bundles weights should carry the licence of the model in question.
